{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\uddbe Overcome obstacles and push your limits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an electrifying 3D platformer where you control a wheelchair-bound character through intense and dynamic challenges. This <strong>offline singleplayer</strong> game puts your skills to the test in levels filled with unpredictable obstacles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fluid and dynamic movement</strong> \u2192 Full control of the wheelchair, including jumps and precise maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging levels</strong> \u2192 Each stage brings new obstacles, requiring agility and strategy to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique progression mechanic</strong> \u2192 Made a mistake? Go back to the previous level and try again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic obstacles</strong> \u2192 Moving platforms, steep ramps, slippery areas, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized and vibrant art</strong> \u2192 A low-poly visual style that enhances the creativity of each challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play at your own pace</strong> \u2192 No internet connection required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score system</strong> \u2192 Get your final score and compare it with your friends. Who will be the best?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy skill-based and precision games where every move counts, this is the perfect challenge for you! \ud83d\ude80</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504700?t=1751421160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/3394b765a535bdbbe97a5578a937de95c17a9e20/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751421160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.